> Explain what on-device AI means in simple terms.
Imagine you have a really smart assistant, like a personal helper, but instead of sending all your information to a giant computer in the cloud (like a big server on the internet), **the smarts are actually living right on your device.**

**On-device AI simply means running the Artificial Intelligence directly on your phone, computer, smart speaker, or any other local device, instead of needing to send everything to the internet to be processed.**

